### Test Email Functionality - Forgot Password with OTP Email

### Step 1: Request OTP (will send email if SMTP configured)
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strEmail": "neminath@admin.com"
}

### Expected Response (Development):
# {
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "If the email exists, an OTP has been sent to it",
#   "data": {
#     "strOTP": "123456",  // Only visible in DEBUG mode
#     "dtOTPExpiry": "2026-01-19T12:30:00Z"
#   }
# }

### Expected Email:
# Subject: Password Reset OTP - Neminath
# Body: Beautiful HTML template with OTP code
# To: neminath@admin.com

---

### Step 2: Reset Password with OTP (will send confirmation email)
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strEmail": "neminath@admin.com",
  "strOTP": "123456",
  "strNewPassword": "NewAdmin@123",
  "strConfirmPassword": "NewAdmin@123"
}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "Password reset successfully",
#   "data": {}
# }

### Expected Email:
# Subject: Password Reset Successful - Neminath
# Body: Confirmation with success icon
# To: neminath@admin.com

---

### Step 3: Login with New Password
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strEmail": "neminath@admin.com",
  "strPassword": "NewAdmin@123"
}

---

### SMTP Configuration Check

# Before testing, update your appsettings.Development.json:

# {
#   "Smtp": {
#     "Host": "smtp.gmail.com",
#     "Port": "587",
#     "Username": "your-email@gmail.com",
#     "Password": "your-16-char-app-password",
#     "FromEmail": "your-email@gmail.com",
#     "FromName": "Neminath Support (Dev)",
#     "EnableSsl": "true"
#   }
# }

# See EMAIL_SETUP.md for detailed SMTP configuration instructions

---

### Notes:

# 1. In DEBUG mode, OTP is returned in response for testing
# 2. In RELEASE mode, OTP is only sent via email (more secure)
# 3. Email sending is fire-and-forget (async) to prevent timing attacks
# 4. Check application logs if emails are not being sent
# 5. OTP expires in 10 minutes

---

### Troubleshooting:

# If emails are not being sent, check:
# 1. SMTP configuration in appsettings.Development.json
# 2. Console logs for error messages: "Failed to send email to..."
# 3. Gmail: Use App Password, not regular password (see EMAIL_SETUP.md)
# 4. Port 587 is not blocked by firewall
# 5. Enable 2FA on Gmail and generate App Password

---

### Change Password Back (if needed)
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN

{
  "strCurrentPassword": "NewAdmin@123",
  "strNewPassword": "Admin@123",
  "strConfirmPassword": "Admin@123"
}
